{"ID":"20260915225309-0occome","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-0occome","title":"LeetCode 1. 两数之和","type":"doc","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-hhymgo9","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-hhymgo9","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260915225309-s4memhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-s4memhn","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"难度：Easy　标签：数组、哈希表　链接：https://leetcode.cn/problems/two-sum/"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-30ibiuj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-30ibiuj","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"题目"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-4uwhlr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-4uwhlr0","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给定一个整数数组 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和一个整数目标值 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"target"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，请你在该数组中找出"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"和为目标值"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong code","TextMarkTextContent":"target"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的那两个整数，并返回它们的数组下标。"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-ewv0u4k","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-ewv0u4k","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-f1b0eg0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-f1b0eg0","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-2cqvmqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-2cqvmqd","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以假设每种输入"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"只会对应一个答案"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，且"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"同一个元素不能用两次"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-ra4d73h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-ra4d73h","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-qplozwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-qplozwr","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"返回答案的顺序任意。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-8l2sbnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-8l2sbnj","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"示例："}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-o3edwbl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-o3edwbl","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-ce1axqz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-ce1axqz","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-ix720bq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-ix720bq","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums = [2,7,11,15], target = 9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → 输出：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[0,1]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（因为 nums[0]+nums[1]==9）"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-mzxtn7t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-mzxtn7t","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-cqwfla1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-cqwfla1","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums = [3,2,4], target = 6"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → 输出：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[1,2]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-fuq9219","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-fuq9219","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-qa6lak8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-qa6lak8","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums = [3,3], target = 6"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → 输出：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[0,1]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-nltut7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-nltut7d","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据范围：​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"2 \u0026lt;= nums.length \u0026lt;= 10^4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-10^9 \u0026lt;= nums[i], target \u0026lt;= 10^9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-tmrj907","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-tmrj907","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"思路"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-9z739h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-9z739h6","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一反应肯定是暴力：两层循环挨个试，看哪两个数加起来等于 target。这题数据量才一万，暴力是能过的。但题目末尾那个 Follow up 明晃晃写着\"能不能做到比 O(n²) 更快\"，那肯定得再想一版。"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-vkuat0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-vkuat0p","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我一开始想：能不能开个数组当哈希表？一看范围就熄火了——​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 能到 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-10^9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，C 语言的数组下标又不能是负数，想开个 20 亿的数组也不现实。所以这里得"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"自己动手写一个哈希表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（反正我也正好想练练手搓数据结构）。"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-jy99yma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-jy99yma","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点就一句话："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"边遍历边把\"已经见过的数\"记进哈希表"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。对当前这个数 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，我先算一下我\"需要\"的那个数 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"need = target - nums[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，然后去哈希表里翻一翻它之前出现过没有："}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-kcngh4y","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-kcngh4y","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-jpt8q2l","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-jpt8q2l","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-f2e5hql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-f2e5hql","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"翻到了 → 大功告成，直接返回 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[那个数的下标, i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​；"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-rcrmtxo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-rcrmtxo","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-irflh1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-irflh1j","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没翻到 → 把 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和它的下标 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 塞进哈希表，继续往后走。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-k89nm3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-k89nm3i","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为我是\"先查再插\"，所以天然就不会用到同一个元素两次，连重复元素的坑都顺手填了。"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-2pw66ht","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-2pw66ht","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-9de7pv2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-9de7pv2","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-tyoxyw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-tyoxyw6","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键点：① 用哈希表把\"回头找另一半\"从 O(n) 降到 O(1)；② 先查后插，保证不重复用同一个元素。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-ki1o077","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-ki1o077","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-qvfoh35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-qvfoh35","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复杂度：暴力 O(n²)；哈希表 O(n) 时间、O(n) 空间。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-46wp1j6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-46wp1j6","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码（C）"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-b1jmbfs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-b1jmbfs","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法一：暴力枚举（好想，但慢）"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-1jjh10r","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-1jjh10r","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// LeetCode 1 两数之和\n// 最简单的一版，先求做出来，能过就行\n// 思路：两层循环，把所有\"两个数的组合\"都试一遍\n\n/**\n * Note: The returned array must be malloced, assume caller calls free().\n * 上面这句是力扣模板自带的提醒：返回的数组得自己 malloc，力扣会自动帮你 free。\n */\nint* twoSum(int* nums, int numsSize, int target, int* returnSize) {\n    int* result = (int*)malloc(2 * sizeof(int)); // 题目保证只有一个答案，开两个 int 就够\n    *returnSize = 0;                             // 先当作\"没找到\"\n\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c numsSize; i++) {         // 第一个数\n        for (int j = i + 1; j \u003c numsSize; j++) { // 第二个数，从 i 后面开始，避免自己和自配、也避免重复\n            if (nums[i] + nums[j] == target) {\n                result[0] = i;\n                result[1] = j;\n                *returnSize = 2;                 // 找到了，长度改成 2\n                return result;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return result; // 题目说有解，理论上走不到这里，但函数得有个兜底 return\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-zxz5f5i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-zxz5f5i","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解法二：手搓哈希表（链地址法，O(n)）"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-ecnoo94","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-ecnoo94","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// LeetCode 1 两数之和 —— 手搓哈希表版本\n// 不想再用两层循环了，这题就该用哈希表。\n// 但 C 语言没有现成的哈希表，只能自己写一个。\n// 为什么不能开数组当下标？因为 nums[i] 小到 -1e9，下标不能为负，空间也开不下。\n// 所以用最经典的\"数组 + 链表\"拉链法：数组是桶，冲突的元素挂在桶后面的链上。\n\n#define HASHSIZE 10007 // 桶的个数，取个质数，冲突少一点\n\ntypedef struct HashNode {\n    int key;                // 存的数值，也就是 nums[i]\n    int idx;                // 这个数值在原数组里的下标\n    struct HashNode* next;  // 拉链：同一个桶里的下一个节点\n} HashNode;\n\n// 哈希函数：把任意 key（可能是负数）映射到 [0, HASHSIZE)\n// 注意：C 语言里负数取模结果还是负数，所以要先取绝对值\n// （这题 nums[i] 最大到 1e9，取绝对值不会溢出 int；要是真遇到 INT_MIN 就得小心了）\nint hashFn(int key) {\n    int x = key \u003c 0 ? -key : key;\n    return x % HASHSIZE;\n}\n\n// 在哈希表里找 key，找到返回它的下标，找不到返回 -1\nint hashFind(HashNode** buckets, int key) {\n    HashNode* p = buckets[hashFn(key)];\n    while (p) {\n        if (p-\u003ekey == key) return p-\u003eidx;\n        p = p-\u003enext;\n    }\n    return -1;\n}\n\n// 头插法把 (key, idx) 塞进哈希表，头插最省事，O(1)\nvoid hashInsert(HashNode** buckets, int key, int idx) {\n    int h = hashFn(key);\n    HashNode* node = (HashNode*)malloc(sizeof(HashNode));\n    node-\u003ekey = key;\n    node-\u003eidx = idx;\n    node-\u003enext = buckets[h]; // 新节点的 next 指向原来桶里的第一个节点\n    buckets[h] = node;       // 桶头换成新节点\n}\n\nint* twoSum(int* nums, int numsSize, int target, int* returnSize) {\n    *returnSize = 2; // 题目保证有解，最后一定是两个下标\n    int* result = (int*)malloc(2 * sizeof(int));\n\n    // calloc 会把所有桶初始化为 NULL，用 malloc 的话还得自己 memset，calloc 省事\n    HashNode** buckets = (HashNode**)calloc(HASHSIZE, sizeof(HashNode*));\n\n    for (int i = 0; i \u003c numsSize; i++) {\n        int need = target - nums[i]; // 我需要的另一半是谁\n\n        int j = hashFind(buckets, need); // 它之前出现过吗？\n        if (j != -1) {\n            // 出现过！那么 (j, i) 就是答案。\n            // 因为我是先查后插，所以 j 一定是\"更早\"的那个下标，不会撞上 i 自己\n            result[0] = j;\n            result[1] = i;\n            return result;\n        }\n\n        // 没找到，就把当前这个数记下来，方便后面的元素来查\n        hashInsert(buckets, nums[i], i);\n    }\n    return result;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-undb1fg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-undb1fg","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地想自己跑一下"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-fwc5gaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-fwc5gaa","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"力扣是\"核心代码模式\"，只交那个函数；但我想自己在本地用样例跑通，就补一个 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"main"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（把上面手搓哈希表的部分整段复制过来即可编译）："}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-43jarxh","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-43jarxh","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Yw=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 本地调试用的 main，力扣提交时不需要这段\n#include \u003cstdio.h\u003e\n#include \u003cstdlib.h\u003e\n\n// ...（把上面解法二的 hashtable 三个函数 + twoSum 贴过来）...\n\nint main() {\n    int nums[] = {2, 7, 11, 15};\n    int target = 9;\n    int returnSize = 0;\n    int* res = twoSum(nums, 4, target, \u0026returnSize);\n    printf(\"返回长度: %d\\n\", returnSize);\n    printf(\"[%d, %d]\\n\", res[0], res[1]); // 期望输出 [0, 1]\n    free(res);\n    return 0;\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-tf6g1zb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-tf6g1zb","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"踩坑与收获"}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-t6s9tly","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-t6s9tly","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-gpwt1yk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-gpwt1yk","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-nfzqcob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-nfzqcob","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"头一回认真用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"calloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​：它和 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"malloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的区别就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"会把内存清零"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这里哈希桶数组必须初始化为 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"NULL"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，不然 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"hashFind"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 里 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"while (p)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 会去读野指针，直接崩。用 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"calloc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 省掉一次 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"memset"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-ayxycwb","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-ayxycwb","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-bdbccid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-bdbccid","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"负数取模"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个坑：C 语言里 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-5 % 3 == -2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（不是 1），所以我先把 key 取了绝对值再取模。以前写代码从没注意过这个，这次被哈希函数逼着想明白了。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-i9lb5aj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-i9lb5aj","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-wcgrv7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-wcgrv7u","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"先查后插\"的顺序很关键：如果我先把 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nums[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 插进去再查 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"target - nums[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，当 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"target = 2 * nums[i]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 时就会查到自己，错用同一个元素。顺序一换，重复元素的问题自动解决（比如 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"[3,3]"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 那个样例）。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260915225309-72oywor","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-72oywor","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260915225309-2o3tkae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260915225309-2o3tkae","updated":"20260915225309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哦买噶，写完才发现：C 语言里想用哈希表，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"要么手搓，要么用第三方库（如 uthash）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不像 C++ 有现成的 ​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"unordered_map"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。这题我算是把拉链法的手感找回来了一点点。"}]}]}]}]}